    {
      "id": "b02",
      "accent": [
        "police",
        "investigation"
      ],
      "text": "But the margin is not the story. On the day of the ceremony, the official Ballon d'Or website published articles naming a winner, hours before it was supposed to be announced. And now there is a police investigation.",
      "visual": {
        "type": "clip",
        "shots": [
          "bayern_b"
