      "id": "b12",
      "accent": [
        "sixth",
        "mistake"
      ],
      "text": "Then there is one juror. Dravko Rijec, a Croatian journalist at Sportske Novosti, has said he made a mistake. On his ballot, Harry Kane was only sixth.",
