    {
      "id": "b16",
      "accent": [
        "28",
        "100"
      ],
      "text": "None of the reports I read says the result was wrong. What they do show is a vote decided by 28 points, across 100 ballots, with one admitted mistake, a website that published several winners, and 12 accounts under suspicion.",
